{"id": "DerTdXfFM-E", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "10 AM, Tatkal opens. One seat, lakhs of people pressing \"Book\" at the same second. How does IRCTC not sell the same seat twice? 🚆\n\n🔒 Lock: the moment you start booking, the seat is locked for you; everyone else bounces off.\n🚶 Queue: requests wait in a line instead of all hitting the database at once.\n📋 Cache: the \"available\" you see is often a slightly old copy, which is why it turns into waiting list when you book.\n🤖 Captcha: to stop bots.\n\nSo what happens when your payment gets stuck? Does the seat stay yours? Comment TATKAL and I'll DM you the full breakdown 📩\n\n#systemdesign #irctc #tatkal #backend #techinhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792425648, "like_count": 19, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141782665575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.568, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMuTqrZMm6FQpnDUH_mnYaRBtlY4gkFDxtZJyciohGXSSGqvxWcsDzmQlAuXPX74xOgw-KHBWU4d4Fyp01mk-WDa3FUQ8FeuYtoijk.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdrQh7SSdKTFUFpwLHZjoKzNx9HtPUfyqQi2YY93hqvLDJjI3dU7rOmHcecYhEPvbg0dvO9N1dweVpH9rj-igyFD&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=6Jmqj-EkuhkQ7kNvwGje0EV&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=isZXuuwfxtTPrld6QBhoEQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRbqniI6g_XMRiHA5-aOi37OniwQ90HVwIIKAR6dWqXSw&oe=6AF404B6", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 61.568, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+